  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://patch.com/connecticut/easthaven/5-things-know-east-haven-early-voting-begins-haunted-trolley-rides-more#main\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Skip to main content</a></p><ul><li><a href=\"https://patch.com/connecticut/branford\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><i></i>Branford, CT</a></li><li><a href=\"https://patch.com/connecticut/newhaven\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><i></i>New Haven, CT</a></li><li><a href=\"https://patch.com/connecticut/northhaven\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><i></i>North Haven, CT</a></li><li><a href=\"https://patch.com/connecticut/westhaven\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><i></i>West Haven, CT</a></li><li><a href=\"https://patch.com/connecticut/northbranford\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><i></i>North Branford, CT</a></li><li><a href=\"https://patch.com/connecticut/hamden\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><i></i>Hamden, CT</a></li><li><a href=\"https://patch.com/connecticut/guilford\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><i></i>Guilford, CT</a></li><li><a href=\"https://patch.com/connecticut/orange\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><i></i>Orange, CT</a></li><li><a href=\"https://patch.com/connecticut/bethwood\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><i></i>Bethwood, CT</a></li><li><a href=\"https://patch.com/connecticut/wallingford\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><i></i>Wallingford, CT</a></li></ul><ul><li><a href=\"https://patch.com/connecticut/across-ct\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><i></i>Connecticut</a></li></ul><ul><li><a href=\"https://patch.com/us/across-america\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><i></i>Top National News</a></li><li><a href=\"https://patch.com/map\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><i></i>See All Communities</a></li></ul><p>EAST HAVEN, CT — Early voting for the Nov. 3 election opens Monday at Town Hall, the Shore Line Trolley Museum starts its Halloween \"In Search of Sasquatch\" rides and the Board of Finance meets Wednesday.</p><p>Here are five things to know about life around East Haven this week:</p> <p>1. <b>Early Voting Opens At Town Hall</b><br />When: Monday, Oct. 19, through Sunday, Nov. 1; Election Day is Tuesday, Nov. 3<br />Where: Lower Level Conference Room, Town Hall, <a href=\"https://u108659709.ct.sendgrid.net/ls/click?upn=u001.NoAuNLMLKGlbrBQ-2FRPL4d5IPu7cXgAYayrmdKG2FKo0mjUFvQh6pWnutPGiqU0W51UZxDvCT9wWaxfsmwBe49TAb0sbEpBKMph-2Fwgcxrrc0sXqoiK99tVotdF-2Fhb-2BJDBz8vSmMoQDWApaJQf3J6TKw-3D-3Dp3_E_2QzLkTcDcAG2RIfsbV4PMrIRL9COWxC4FcR-2FaLUaNSk4G5o8K1oAFVk3060ey-2FyGy3HwWuO-2F69cdSEOzfAEbNLFTx6YixkZLu3AaTJvOsGzjd-2FyjhP7zuQnt7wBuDPDPBnFpZTNBAqLLUOi9Yvc8C9CIU95WS0ZkfqYTqXHz5d6kLMice216HyCBqbKUSKvo1OlgeIy6dJOXH3cF7afvkw-3D-3D\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">250 Main St.</a><br />What to know: East Haven's early voting site has been the lower-level conference room at Town Hall, according to the Secretary of the State's list of early voting locations. State law sets early voting hours at 10 a.m. to 6 p.m., with extended 8 a.m. to 8 p.m. hours on Tuesday, Oct. 27, and Thursday, Oct. 29. Questions go to the registrars at <a>203-468-3320</a>.<br /><a href=\"https://u108659709.ct.sendgrid.net/ls/click?upn=u001.NoAuNLMLKGlbrBQ-2FRPL4d4KgNAC0skTTeuC1PZ1B4ftOOceB-2BoGHlkhe5PWmDWmxdm1nj0NYK-2BpXHLqGu3gkbixbWl9wt6w4QYycw07BVecoZK8w6nc4DhlX3Js-2B1aCTWL8GxmVsZmG-2F648xd2mv9-2FUjI-2FcGC-2BynzwW7JfkecgA-3DEMRN_2QzLkTcDcAG2RIfsbV4PMrIRL9COWxC4FcR-2FaLUaNSk4G5o8K1oAFVk3060ey-2FyGipf8krmmUTzQQyUd4B-2B9xioHop5igU2R-2B4CoEKHTFo3NE5PxfqGTM6JygUzJbI6LVootryAqn8mjDQlpdmEW3LqtAmHEi3qehdv7OoPYSNWchJf8X8Q-2BqwpgPe3ueXKljmKFaTidpcqFEPUc50ZD6g-3D-3D\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">More information here.</a></p><h2>Find out what's happening in East Havenfor free with the latest updates from Patch.</h2><p>2. <b>Haunted Trolley: In Search Of Sasquatch</b><br />When: Friday and Saturday, Oct. 23-24, rides at 6, 7, 8 and 9 p.m.<br />Where: Shore Line Trolley Museum, <a href=\"https://u108659709.ct.sendgrid.net/ls/click?upn=u001.NoAuNLMLKGlbrBQ-2FRPL4d5IPu7cXgAYayrmdKG2FKo0mjUFvQh6pWnutPGiqU0W5-2FygIfJM7YcMg-2Btc8cFOSMOaxkCYhierRHeWPCzsHPK1-2FPQvti5ZfVXqhiOTmV4APFFBjZxT2CQtXaIClnBio8A-3D-3DA-if_2QzLkTcDcAG2RIfsbV4PMrIRL9COWxC4FcR-2FaLUaNSk4G5o8K1oAFVk3060ey-2FyGbxmENzuHPXafnBBesWcI-2FvGlU1m-2F8KRbAzkpzWFK6uej4P5SbHHfOopRsKzRvVPOt0TBcLPUlHN51DVn4TVlJV08n2-2B6bkWmj7-2FfW2Wrtrno2Cb9aG-2FY9O-2FhEwnklakvY0zw3LFL1f7qi7Uf97LSIg-3D-3D\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">17 River St.</a><br />What to know: The Shore Line Trolley Museum's Halloween ride this year is a 30- to 45-minute interactive Bigfoot comedy show aboard a historic trolley, limited to 40 passengers per ride, according to the museum. Tickets are $29 in advance only, and riders under 16 need an adult.<br /><a href=\"https://u108659709.ct.sendgrid.net/ls/click?upn=u001.NoAuNLMLKGlbrBQ-2FRPL4dy9iHpi6GJam6HITr9bj5NW-2FEqZhXQT2utlp-2BJGmAvgDy4hSEpdQvMBGD-2FXO74e8M9cS-2BY6yI3KXVcw4Ai3ywXqtvLw-2FqKvlkQi00N4oXs-2BxrTmb_2QzLkTcDcAG2RIfsbV4PMrIRL9COWxC4FcR-2FaLUaNSk4G5o8K1oAFVk3060ey-2FyGexH9wOJ84KAfSWtz0ov7Bd3MxSZ5bVCr28z7B4634e8D4AYaU4QxfedeFbSAoIsEs-2Fq-2Fm2CqfX39bCUKGzYHeYTgiCl0kpBnx1MYOvL-2BasUAZQYDtkuONFmHY6mrFTFaUC-2Fa2idZADlKzdbncmXGfQ-3D-3D\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">More information here.</a></p> <p>3. <b>Pumpkin Patch Trolley Rides</b><br />When: Saturday, Oct. 24, 10:30 a.m. to 5 p.m. (last trolley at 4 p.m.)<br />Where: Shore Line Trolley Museum, <a href=\"https://u108659709.ct.sendgrid.net/ls/click?upn=u001.NoAuNLMLKGlbrBQ-2FRPL4d5IPu7cXgAYayrmdKG2FKo0mjUFvQh6pWnutPGiqU0W5-2FygIfJM7YcMg-2Btc8cFOSMOaxkCYhierRHeWPCzsHPK1-2FPQvti5ZfVXqhiOTmV4APFFBjZxT2CQtXaIClnBio8A-3D-3DKRy6_2QzLkTcDcAG2RIfsbV4PMrIRL9COWxC4FcR-2FaLUaNSk4G5o8K1oAFVk3060ey-2FyG392khE-2Bg5cc7vnJiMb-2B7ifoQqYopM0q9Y7Cs7gDizeOrGCqPSc2I48DCz4ogHg-2B0nKTLziKofEPS-2BsJhWsgkR5ylBJYR209mWv4hnhiyTNDGLFlbN1WSAqIeIBrYQeq51UIBYndf7RVMo8oSVPD7Cg-3D-3D\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">17 River St.</a><br />What to know: Families can take a trolley ride to the museum's pumpkin patch, pick a sugar pumpkin to take home and join seasonal activities, according to the museum. The pumpkin patch runs on weekends in October. Reservations: <a>203-467-6927</a>.<br /><a href=\"https://u108659709.ct.sendgrid.net/ls/click?upn=u001.NoAuNLMLKGlbrBQ-2FRPL4dy9iHpi6GJam6HITr9bj5NUTiIebITR-2FtRJ4ULIl7-2FHWV5K2xILlrB2R9BPT5aeH3XrLDzx1K0JK08unP7cq9j3npdrHSnxWXMqYiMgnp-2FH3q5qF_2QzLkTcDcAG2RIfsbV4PMrIRL9COWxC4FcR-2FaLUaNSk4G5o8K1oAFVk3060ey-2FyGaIfs1KzCq31qKOAJ5-2BiPKQT51aHZp7Q3Lxv6ux8D7ltdZcY-2B-2FXnX-2FNeExzV7-2F5xr2fsX-2F-2FZPIIznhY4x702Va60aKjQFIsP1qFlfiCOqQwe4VFiaUXE6X-2FyrCGWaMW0bd8chZboVMbuSGh0X1NTyag-3D-3D\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">More information here.</a></p><h2>Find out what's happening in East Havenfor free with the latest updates from Patch.</h2><p>4. <b>Board Of Finance Meets</b><br />When: Wednesday, Oct. 21, 7 p.m.<br />Where: Lower Level Conference Room, Town Hall, <a href=\"https://u108659709.ct.sendgrid.net/ls/click?upn=u001.NoAuNLMLKGlbrBQ-2FRPL4d5IPu7cXgAYayrmdKG2FKo0mjUFvQh6pWnutPGiqU0W51UZxDvCT9wWaxfsmwBe49TAb0sbEpBKMph-2Fwgcxrrc0sXqoiK99tVotdF-2Fhb-2BJDBz8vSmMoQDWApaJQf3J6TKw-3D-3DVwbM_2QzLkTcDcAG2RIfsbV4PMrIRL9COWxC4FcR-2FaLUaNSk4G5o8K1oAFVk3060ey-2FyGBrLe9MLTkr6QL5vidQsO-2FVifkl5tDBy2CPIBJx8L6EEHqOiYf3NR3L7-2BONtcWYK8fX6jQBx4uEcyMfKuNhUl5Twit7l0ZyRb9cU-2BWLa1ueZ2muYrw6vYcVQn4pTOzJzfgaDSiuqPrsM4Cq9CGi1jbg-3D-3D\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">250 Main St.</a><br />What to know: The Board of Finance holds its meeting, according to the town calendar. The agenda had not been posted as of Friday, Oct. 16.<br /><a href=\"https://u108659709.ct.sendgrid.net/ls/click?upn=u001.NoAuNLMLKGlbrBQ-2FRPL4d1yBmnQMk4AYcXorjkdOF-2F-2Fqp6vabyJTE0O8RoqEnmn0KOqNFEIs0-2FJBRWRUBq-2B8eg-3D-3DYpGI_2QzLkTcDcAG2RIfsbV4PMrIRL9COWxC4FcR-2FaLUaNSk4G5o8K1oAFVk3060ey-2FyGltuqk0r-2FfaHCFrpGwnWYBeE1C5J8wXdPI0vuIkw8i0aUEayBtTiytVzNvpGEsGVqZ5Omw7mjN9yGL-2FaIagYXx-2Fg1-2FBY5JvPnNVHCnOVkda9HOk4kDKxWdLt3qBf2e4ZJwozcIHvgv4QmaobApcLTag-3D-3D\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">More information here.</a></p> <p>5. <b>Arts Commission, Housing Authority Meet</b><br />When: Arts Commission Tuesday, Oct. 20, 7 p.m.; Housing Authority Thursday, Oct. 22, 7 p.m.<br />Where: Arts Commission: Hays School, <a href=\"https://u108659709.ct.sendgrid.net/ls/click?upn=u001.NoAuNLMLKGlbrBQ-2FRPL4d5IPu7cXgAYayrmdKG2FKo0mjUFvQh6pWnutPGiqU0W5ZzT0DG8FdCeNkaguZk7JS-2FXgZ-2B7qyRCJ7I6Lx0QkfFfeQK6CFhL9fBQjtYec3PI0fE68AydBqDT57fqvvnEO1A-3D-3DVKve_2QzLkTcDcAG2RIfsbV4PMrIRL9COWxC4FcR-2FaLUaNSk4G5o8K1oAFVk3060ey-2FyGj-2Fch6-2FE6nxN2dugU7ivA8EG8k58oUmldvZzFLmD6tSKeDPLxiJuC0O2uhgvZhisEeXcDedylTBCMcRx97w1-2FqogHbivHwxoXfCVSv2hZlBdEhfLNnrfaEcwJXbNXW48zGzuhM32BMr5DyLWJ8YVJtQ-3D-3D\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">1 Maple St.</a>; Housing Authority: Mayor's Conference Room, Town Hall, <a href=\"https://u108659709.ct.sendgrid.net/ls/click?upn=u001.NoAuNLMLKGlbrBQ-2FRPL4d5IPu7cXgAYayrmdKG2FKo0mjUFvQh6pWnutPGiqU0W51UZxDvCT9wWaxfsmwBe49TAb0sbEpBKMph-2Fwgcxrrc0sXqoiK99tVotdF-2Fhb-2BJDBz8vSmMoQDWApaJQf3J6TKw-3D-3D7xaA_2QzLkTcDcAG2RIfsbV4PMrIRL9COWxC4FcR-2FaLUaNSk4G5o8K1oAFVk3060ey-2FyGRjgTnxFxNpo2NWjomnegGIfR0U4nOl21oGt1WJGt1VGrGGxXiakatx3LLkh-2BGzNdS9o4qDOULba0RmRyucY1aR3AFxcHVeHiiQjX231ryyQAeGGjye-2FpjRxwdL7NoB3YZ7U2fh0F1REGSlP6aG07Ig-3D-3D\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">250 Main St.</a><br />What to know: The East Haven Arts Commission meets Tuesday at Hays School, according to the town calendar. The Housing Authority holds a special meeting Thursday in the upper-level Mayor's Conference Room to hear the director's report, according to its agenda.<br /><a href=\"https://u108659709.ct.sendgrid.net/ls/click?upn=u001.NoAuNLMLKGlbrBQ-2FRPL4d1yBmnQMk4AYcXorjkdOF-2F-2FFm4ZIrO7dHCz14bhQTKklRiv2ScvBdrQ0ZcT9w9sBuh9AtMnRBcFL6-2BhTS-2FnuJLt-2BUat4LByn-2Boc4x19ntis5KMij_2QzLkTcDcAG2RIfsbV4PMrIRL9COWxC4FcR-2FaLUaNSk4G5o8K1oAFVk3060ey-2FyGd6ALKLieBYPf-2F13ETkQS69CsU9RyNhhRDpidiUkEvsRQwwhRGEfSN9A0oHzKCu1ZNWihdyvj0AebzgjG0EbhwJ2sAQrjAu5ucgrymlDkKolanxGFpC8xOGzynD1CRw32hBDRKFqADbaaaKah2RSZvw-3D-3D\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">More information here.</a></p><p>Get more local news delivered straight to your inbox. <a href=\"https://patch.com/connecticut/easthaven/subscribe\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Sign up for free Patch newsletters and alerts.</a></p>"
